# NFTBan Web GUI - IP Access Control
# ===================================
# This file controls which IPs can access the nftban-ui web interface.
# One entry per line (supports IP and CIDR notation)
# Comments start with #
#
# This is SEPARATE from the firewall whitelist (/etc/nftban/whitelist.d/)
# The firewall whitelist controls which IPs bypass firewall rules.
# This file controls which IPs can access the admin web interface.

# Localhost (always allowed for health checks)
127.0.0.1
::1

# Server's own IPs (auto-populated during install)
# {{SERVER_IPS}}

# Admin networks (add your management IPs/ranges here)
# Example:
# 10.0.0.0/8          # Internal network
# 192.168.1.100       # Admin workstation
# 203.0.113.0/24      # Office network

# WARNING: Uncomment below ONLY for testing (allows ALL access)
# 0.0.0.0/0
# ::/0
